ion/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Challenge_Room\" title=\"Boss Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/5b/Boss_Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102254\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Needles</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" title=\"Monsters\">monsters</a> that resemble a miniature <a href=\"/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a>, and added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Repentance\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Repentance\">The Binding of Isaac: Repentance</a></i> DLC.\n</p><p>They lunge towards Isaac in an attempt to deal contact damage. Before they lunge, they are characterized by a small lump in the ground. Unlike Pin, they do not move underground relative to where they land. Instead, they teleport to a spot near Isaac before lunging. They can leap over pits and obstacles to reach Isaac if he has flight.\n</p><p>Needles will not leave a cloud of smoke upon spawning within a given <a href=\"/wiki/Rooms\" title=\"Rooms\">room</a>.\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pasty\">Pasty</span></h3><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"P\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat P.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_P.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/bd/Font_TeamMeat_P.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822055823\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"a\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat a.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_a.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Font_TeamMeat_a.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060324\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"s\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat s.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_s.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wi